  "request_id": "343305de-46f0-41dc-81aa-b26a795ba2cc",
  "content": {
    "title": "终于实现了！把你的几千个文件这样交给本地大模型，随便问，还不限次！",
    "user_name": "gh_ce69fa698e90",
    "nick_name": "郭震AI",
    "create_time": "2026-10-14 11:22",
    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">你好，我是郭震！</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">我经常会遇到这样的痛点，就是电脑里，有各种文件散落在不同的文件夹，想找一句话、核对一个数据，太费劲了，最后可能找半天都无功而返。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">相信你也有遇到过。今天这篇文章我们看看如何解决</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">1 通用智能体</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">Codex，Claude code，豆包，Workbuddy，这些智能体强还是很强，但很难从几千个文件根据问题意思找全答案。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">如下图所示，强入Claude code ，哪怕配备 Opus 5.5，直接问它能不能做到：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDiaRoVdwGIw73UNfKb9mvQZpH16NlqUbmeIuiaWnccxWoPlTH4MZj1HvcIdulzo0K1LgIl8nXk4XRKyZvQdSK7l4H66ksQiaQZJU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4981481481481482\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041785\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;background-color: rgb(212, 250, 0);\">它的答案非常诚实：不能</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">不用关键词、只靠问题的大意，2 分钟连其中一小部分都读不完，更谈不上准确找到答案。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">于是RAG知识库诞生了，如比较知名的：腾讯IMA，谷歌NotebookLLM，很多人都在每天使用。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">我也经常在用，但是我发现NotebookLLM一个知识库，</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: bold;\">即便是Pro也只能放入300个文件</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYDLkAQphibgicO5rhs2vPqF7DPpG1BfHpEDEghw1CTe7SHHLTXgF7UoID8NazGYb3cdCqXa2nYcRAXXicdZ9Eqz0HC3BfD2bORhkA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5120274914089347\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"582\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041786\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">一个知识库只能放最多300个文件，这个量级真的不够用，咱们不说企业，就是个人，使用电脑1年多，随随便便就超过三百。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">更糟的是，我在使用NotebookLLM时，PDF里的公式和表格几乎导入后排版全部乱掉：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYAgwa4cMzwCgUBRtAMaGxIEWHQNUwk7iaEAvsoxiaEB4lKBAqYHPIFw8gAibXHP0rKeGMvT2hB4h0nO3XNGdtX34DIYE2f8zic5Kl4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4918444165621079\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"797\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041787\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">在此不再一一列举，如何解决这样的问题呢？</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: bold;\">于是我们开发了DeepLocals知识库。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">它的出现，就是专门为了解决以上这些问题，不仅一个卡片能支持几千个文件，而且还能跨知识库语义检索：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYCxExqoe0sQEn0F4mHeQrmbv08EgT5xg2CXcUfH8sdpYjTEvJCtaqMI6aldAh8cN9lrhDXbrsZA69YicXZzNxqibon2jfibqVIotk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5287037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041788\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: bold;\">配备本地大模型Qwen3.8:27B，直接对上千个本地电脑文件做知识问答，随便问，还不限次：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100041823\" data-ratio=\"0.587037037037037\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYCjRIu6RXTpScT69SG4pOEjXU2iaQyM2ZbKcEIMDEic7a4OvydYw5uceJ4NficKJnIpYib64PnmOYA7wefd2uACduKOIXQ7cZCibibVk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">而且导入的文件，即便难度很大的扫描件，公式、图片和排版也能基本保留，如下图所示为导入到DeepLocals后的文件显示：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100041790\" data-ratio=\"0.38055555555555554\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYAXDicmiaLMrlWMxBrYdamERHCeKozPHyftHs92BD1togxtYdU1JiasHGGSrgB2WfJ3JonAeTSJb3xFa7v0unsicCHjYnuk3trjKh8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">2 DeepLocals和LLM Wiki区别</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">LLM Wiki 是前段时间 Karpathy 提出的一个思路，让大模型把资料整理成一份 Wiki 来问答。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">概念很巧，几十份文档，玩一下，挺好。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">但是资料一多、格式一杂就难以支撑。DeepLocals 从一开始就是按真实工作场景设计的，一个知识库能胜任几千个文件，知识问答精度也有保证，如下从一千多个文件做知识问答，即便带有思考+规划+多轮检索：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/SxpC5raqFYBvp1DicgaoxBwFVLicdb1YOhCzYzr5dLNG64YzIZXotGGDRY2E7LAVjdjua0jUPBB1SpmlSPgyAjbOQ3kjk2s4OZkKRWG8AzP44/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.577386468952734\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041792\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/SxpC5raqFYBlu5oIvBuMcQZHG5SsWVrKvdEsDUB6E6p6ibvJcI46EAazw61T5Nb1jrf31ia8jd9hcGYjubWiaIcGpOy27db1QiaqhfVm311EUM8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5777777777777777\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041791\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">从思考到完整回复完成，只有48秒：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYBicCFImSXa9sFuUENRzImWAhcvuMicW8aq5tObecQRqUoicewTPHkfIiaNCvXnrb0nPgIhZMc6PLbnoWZwCP2G51mUmOunDIfHpn4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.49952696310312206\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1057\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041794\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">以上GIF动画，未经任何加速处理， 完整保证1:1速度还原，就是让大家看到真实的回复速度。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">一句话：LLM Wiki只是一个玩具，几十个文件导入回答没问题；但是再多，还得使用IMA，NotebookLLM，DeepLocals这样的RAG知识库。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 2px;color: rgb(0, 82, 255);font-weight: bold;\">3 DeepLocals的使用教程</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;background-color: rgb(212, 250, 0);font-weight: bold;\">DeepLocals第一个特色</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;background-color: rgb(212, 250, 0);font-weight: normal;\">：</span><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: normal;\">支持本地电脑海量文件的学习，如下我的电脑6839个文件：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SxpC5raqFYAQQprQ2wKrnABs0u32vialaA7W8xDrI4qkqSIUC7ictr4wd0YdLzJcQxEVHOPpasKSibpgJERRHvB7lLdUrrrWvsuboKA2390Qicc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6070763500931099\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1074\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100041796\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: normal;\">16个知识库，每个卡片就是一个知识库。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.6;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:null},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;data-layout-id&quot;:null}]\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-weight: normal;\">新建卡片，立即拥有1个知识库，点击进入就会看到下面界面：</span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center;